Package: mc-tui
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), openjdk-8-jre, openjdk-17-jre, openjdk-21-jre, openjdk-25-jre
Maintainer: heaway <heaway@localhost>
Description: Terminal User Interface Minecraft Launcher
 MC-TUI is a lightweight, zero-dependency Terminal User Interface (TUI)
 Minecraft launcher designed specifically for discovering and launching local
 Minecraft files.
 .
 Features:
  - 100% offline, local-first launcher
  - Vanilla, Fabric, Forge, NeoForge, Quilt, and OptiFine support
  - Smart Java runtime detection (Java 8, 11, 17, 21, 25)
  - Interactive curses TUI and headless CLI mode
